              "notes": ["创作者终局依赖 Bonestorm 打 Boss 伤害。"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "overview",
      "id": "plant-mechanics",
      "title": "植物体系如何运作",
      "order": 80,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Entangle 定身敌人；Thrashing Vines 与 Thunderstorm 追加伤害；Accelerated Growth 把藤蔓引爆为全屏植物爆炸。一旦施放，循环是自动的，这正是清图快的原因。",
        "构筑依靠 Eternal Life 维持永久低血：一旦拥有能量护盾，生命不再变化，把你锁定在 35% 以下以触发低血增益。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "type": "mapping",
      "id": "mapping",
      "title": "清图循环",
      "order": 90,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "向怪群施放 Entangle，叠加 Thrashing Vines 与 Thunderstorm，再由 Accelerated Growth 引爆。持续移动；爆炸负责清理。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
    {
      "type": "bossing",
      "id": "bossing",
      "title": "Boss 循环",
      "order": 100,
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "用 Bonestorm 对 Boss 进行单体爆发，保留植物层清理小怪。Rupture the Flesh 让被诅咒的敌人像免费Detonate Dead一样爆炸。"
      ],
      "bullets": []
    },
